Everybody and his brother [sexist phrase!] seems to want one of
these, so I figured I'd post the termcap I wrote when I was using
one of these, uh, things.  (Were this net.flame, I'd call it what
it is.)

av|view|Adds Viewpoint:\
	:am:bs:bw:ce=\EK:cl=^L:cm=\EY%+ %+ :co#80:li#24:ll=^A:nd=^F:\
	:se=^O:so=^N:ti=\E0P:up=^Z:

The dumb thing has no line or character insert or delete.  At least
it doesn't use magic cookies.  I use the ti string to change the
attribute to inverse video; if you prefer one of the other modes,
change the 0 to anything between 0 and 3 (I think).

The only redeeming feature of the Viewpoint is the detached keyboard
and the kute koil kord konnecting it.

Seriously, the termcap is for real.  Enjoy!
